abstract: >
  This repository provides FAIR-ready curation artifacts for the reorganization
and standardization of lithium-ion battery aging measurements originally
released by the NASA Ames Prognostics Center of Excellence (PCoE). The dataset focuses on the ARC 29–32
  subset, covering four cells (B0029–B0032) with charge, discharge, and
  electrochemical impedance spectroscopy data. The contribution of this work
  lies in improving data findability, accessibility, interoperability, and
  reusability through structured formats and rich metadata, while preserving
  the original scientific content and legal status of the NASA data.

